\section{Testing}

Tests follow the code they verify.
The client holds a shared cache, so before every test we clear it;
otherwise a DOI cached by one test would answer the next test's lookup
without reaching the replayed response.
The conftest's network guard (\cref{sec:test-configuration}) fails any
test that would reach the real service.

